From 4ca596c8222fff337e2a18d8feb59a9fd4eae22a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
Date: Tue, 7 Jul 2026 06:37:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Block restricted addresses in web-download import URIs

Reject import URIs targeting loopback, link-local, private, reserved,
multicast, or unspecified addresses unless the host is listed in
allowed_hosts. Also reject hostnames that resolve to those addresses.

Closes-Bug: #2158998
SecurityImpact

Assisted-By: Cursor (claude-4.5-sonnet)
Change-Id: I49c926fdeeac75f72e19dbf8c2124b46a1f12f37
Signed-off-by: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 2a2d51f606807428240215117fea358c98788b84)

